koko de

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.600
ここで

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.600
right here

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:37.780
This image is from 24 hours ago. And this is from one hour ago.

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:42.470
So, Saint's colony fleet has grown again.

00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:46.360
But the rate of increase has remained unchanged these past few days.

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:48.960
And Management's activity?

00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:54.150
Changes we believe to be based on a military buildup plan are still underway.

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.730
When do you suppose X-Day will be?

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:04.040
I doubt it will be today or tomorrow. But it will be soon, that's for sure.

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:06.500
Should we report to the Leader?

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:11.030
I see no need. There's no overt activity today.

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:15.810
I suppose you're right. For today at least...

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:21.070
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:21.070
<b>Grandfather and Grandson</b>

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:23.200
Your grandfather?

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:24.510
On my mother's side.

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:28.280
I know it's sudden, but he said he wanted to see me again since it's been so long.

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:30.450
So I'd like him to stay the night.

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:31.610
You don't mind, do you?

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:38.900
What are you saying? If he's your grandfather, whether I mind or not doesn't enter into it!

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:45.770
To tell you the truth, he's always busy, so I haven't seen him very many times.

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:53.140
Hey, do you know the name Yuichiro Konoe, chairman of Konoe Heavy Industries?

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:58.020
Who is he?

00:02:58.290 --> 00:02:59.520
He's my grandfather.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:12.100
Coming!

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:16.210
Hey! It's been a long time, Suguru.

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:18.930
It sure has, Grandpa.

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:20.340
How do you do.

00:03:21.450 --> 00:03:26.340
Oh, this is Mahoro and her little sister, Minawa. They work here as live-in maids.

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:29.070
H-How do you do.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:34.490
She looks like a sweet girl!

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.360
Hey, this house looks like it was just built.

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:43.120
Yeah, but before Mahoro came, everybody said it looked like a haunted house.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:49.820
Mahoro was responsible for this, too.

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:55.250
You seem to enjoy your work.

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:59.230
N-No, sir, I'd never dream of taking matters so lightly.

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:04.900
It is part of my duties, so whether I enjoy it or not isn't...

00:04:04.900 --> 00:04:08.970
Just because it's your job doesn't mean you can't enjoy it, Mahoro.

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:14.630
Yes, sir. You... You're right. I do enjoy it.

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:24.630
That smells terrific!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.570
I think I'll have a little taste...

00:04:27.040 --> 00:04:28.740
It's not ready yet.

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.430
C'mon, why not?

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:32.670
No!

00:04:32.670 --> 00:04:33.970
Just a little taste!

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:34.420
Absolutely not!

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:35.000
G-Grandpa?

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:38.350
I won't stand for childish behavior!

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:40.840
Can I PLEASE have a little taste?

00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:43.800
Please? Pretty please?

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:44.270
S-Stop that!

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:48.920
Needs more salt.

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:52.450
As it is, the flavors of the ingredients aren't coming together.

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:55.330
You shouldn't taste that yet! It's not done!

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.100
It's only natural that you don't like the taste.

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:00.160
Oh, don't try to talk your way out of it.

00:05:01.010 --> 00:05:03.980
In this case, salt goes in last as a hidden flavor.

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:06.100
Finished dishes are one thing,

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:10.750
...but I won't allow anyone to lay a finger on food that is still being cooked!

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.550
To a maid, the kitchen is a battlefield where she puts herself on the line,

00:05:14.980 --> 00:05:17.540
...but you only have yourself to blame for letting your guard down.

00:05:18.200 --> 00:05:20.950
If you're just going to split hairs, I'll show you no mercy!

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:23.270
This should be good! I accept your challenge!

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:25.750
Big sister, you can do it!

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:30.990
Hey, what are you doing, Mahoro?

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:32.470
You, too, Grandpa!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.510
Stand aside, Suguru!

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:52.320
M-Mahoro, you went too far, whatever your reasons were!

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:54.020
Grandpa?

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:59.410
This is what I was searching for! This! This! This! This!

00:05:59.770 --> 00:06:01.850
I was an orphan, never knowing my parents,

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:05.290
...and grew up tasting the hardships the world had to offer.

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:08.750
I swore the following hate-filled oath to the red, setting sun.

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:13.930
"I will crawl my way up and stand at the top of the world one day!"

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:17.360
And then one day, I realized that every last person around me...

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:22.940
...was sucking up to me out of fear.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:28.130
But one woman, one woman was different.

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:35.760
Risa, who loved me as an ordinary man in spite of my great wealth and power.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.880
Oh, my beautiful wife!

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:42.880
It's all a lie. Don't believe a word of it.

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:45.840
What's your problem?! I was just getting to the good part!

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.680
Butt out!

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:51.980
You told me once that your family was stinking rich!

00:06:52.150 --> 00:06:53.840
And I hear that the reason Grandma left you is because...

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:56.120
...she found out that you were sleeping around!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:59.410
Sheesh, you pick the most annoying stuff to remember, you know that?

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.100
Bingo!

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:03.460
Coming, coming, coming!

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:10.170
All these girls, and only one boy...

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:11.740
Which means that...

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:16.190
Suguru, you're... You're a chick magnet? Are you a chick magnet?!

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:20.430
You're a chick magnet?! You're a chick magnet at YOUR age?!

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:22.020
I hate you!

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:23.980
Bonjour, Misato!

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:28.640
Today, I will show you a licentious world, the likes of which you can't imagine!

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:34.650
Suguru, who's this?

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:36.200
My homeroom teacher.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:37.630
WHAT?

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:42.620
Ew, Misato, who's this weird old geezer?

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.640
H-He's my grandpa.

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:48.360
Suguru, what the hell kind of junior high student ARE you?

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.140
Nobody special.

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:54.630
But they're so boingy... Full, ripe, and boingy...

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:57.030
I wanna nurse on 'em!

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:01.020
Cut it out, Grandpa! Grandpa!

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:03.020
Dirty thoughts...

00:08:03.170 --> 00:08:04.690
...are bad!

00:08:05.930 --> 00:08:06.350
Huh?

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:09.870
Coming...

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:11.120
Good afternoon.

00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:15.390
Oh, Mr. Ryuga. Why are you here?

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:19.600
It's the strangest thing. I found this in my jacket.

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.260
What horrible writing...

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:24.370
Let me see...

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:29.710
"Bring this paper to Suguru Misato's house. You'll be rewarded."

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:31.360
What's this all about?

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:34.950
I have trouble holding pencils, all right?

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:35.280
I don't really expect a reward or anything.

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:37.870
I don't normally go to someone's house...

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:36.460
Slash?

00:08:37.970 --> 00:08:40.310
...on the say-so of a paper scrap in my pocket...

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:42.480
You may as well feed the sucker a nice meal.

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:42.480
...and not knowing what this "reward" might be,

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:45.180
...but I make a point of trying to be helpful.

00:08:44.560 --> 00:08:45.010
Sure!

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:51.270
What is it?

00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:54.020
You're a real good-lookin' guy.

00:08:54.420 --> 00:08:58.390
I'm guessing that a teacher with your looks must be real popular, if you know what I mean.

00:08:58.870 --> 00:08:59.560
Popular?

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.610
I don't talk to popular guys.

00:09:08.240 --> 00:09:10.650
But since you're here and all, have a drink with me!

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:13.800
Thank you, but unfortunately, I can't accept.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:16.470
What?! You're too good to drink with me?!

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:18.900
You don't seem to be aware of this,

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:23.410
...but in this country, consumption of alcohol by minors is prohibited by law.

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:26.240
What's that got to do with you?

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:30.270
Everything. You see, I'm only three years old.

00:09:30.550 --> 00:09:32.540
You must be drunk already!

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:35.280
Meow. Meow.

00:09:35.990 --> 00:09:39.200
That guy is the Saint android I told you about.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:43.790
He's so honest he's an idiot. He's not such a bad guy.

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:46.260
Slash...

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:48.880
You do such a great kitty-cat impersonation!

00:09:50.650 --> 00:09:53.110
I see we must humor our elders.

00:09:54.210 --> 00:09:54.940
I have no choice, then.

00:09:57.240 --> 00:10:00.470
Gotcha! Gotcha! I shook it a hundred times before giving it to you!

00:10:01.720 --> 00:10:06.540
I-I'm sorry, Mr. Ryuga. My grandfather's a little drunk.

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:10.580
W-Well, we must humor our elders, after all.

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:11.540
Here.

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:14.100
Thank you.

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:23.600
Minawa, what's the matter?

00:10:23.870 --> 00:10:25.750
Could I have another towel, please?

00:10:26.610 --> 00:10:30.570
Don't let long things get'cha down!

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:33.480
Like long, dangling noodles, and...

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:36.010
Oh, brother...

00:10:36.600 --> 00:10:39.590
Still, your grandpa seems like a lot of fun.

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:44.980
She's right. I had no idea you had a grandfather like that, Suguru.

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:47.930
I wanna have a grandpa like him, too!

00:10:48.600 --> 00:10:52.660
O-Oh, and what do you mean by THAT, I wonder?

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:56.690
I don't think we can let that one pass.

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:59.020
There's no hidden meaning to it!

00:10:58.580 --> 00:10:59.720
I'll just bet.

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:10.170
Thanks for dinner!

00:11:10.470 --> 00:11:11.690
Sure thing. See you.

00:11:11.870 --> 00:11:15.190
No, no! I wanna drink some more, Misato!

00:11:15.190 --> 00:11:17.090
Pull yourself together, Ms. Shikijo.

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:20.470
How about one for the road...?

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:22.310
Dirty thoughts are bad!

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:22.310
Dirty thoughts are bad!

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:34.180
All of today's work is done, so we'll go relax in the bath.

00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:36.560
Sure! Thanks for all the hard work today.

00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:37.990
Yes, well done.

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:44.760
Okay, what say we get going, too?

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:46.130
Huh? To where?

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:48.830
Where else? To peek!

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:51.180
Wha...?! P-Peek?!

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:55.920
Damn it, I was waiting for you to invite ME, but I can't wait anymore!

00:11:56.510 --> 00:11:57.200
I'm going in first!

00:11:57.430 --> 00:12:00.030
W-Wait a minute! Don't do that!

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:03.680
Oh, don't hold back on my account, Suguru.

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:05.400
Or is it something else?

00:12:06.110 --> 00:12:08.390
You aren't telling me that you won't let me see...

00:12:08.610 --> 00:12:11.430
...these two lovelies you've got in your house, are you?

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:14.010
I-I'm not going to go peek on them.

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:15.730
W-What?!

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:19.280
It's not that I don't understand your feelings of shyness,

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:21.510
...but be true to yourself, my grandson.

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:26.170
If I went and peeked on them, I know I'd hurt Mahoro's and Minawa's feelings.

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:28.840
That's very admirable of you.

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:32.670
In which case, we'll just make sure we're not caught, and nobody will get hurt!

00:12:32.910 --> 00:12:35.920
That's the same! That's the same thing!

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.780
What can I say to make you go along?

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:42.770
I'm not going no matter what you say, and that's that.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.760
You've got a few porn magazines, don't you?

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:54.270
Well, yeah, but... Mahoro took them all away.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:58.630
You've never seen a real, live naked woman, have you?

00:12:58.910 --> 00:13:02.330
Sure I have! There was that time when I was in the bath with Mahoro, and...

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:07.960
I-In the bath with Mahoro?

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:12.470
What a laugh. I see I'm preaching to the choir here.

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:14.780
So, you and she...

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:17.810
I can see why peeking would seem foolish.

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:19.380
I-It's not like that!

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:22.950
Mahoro walked in on me, saying that she'd wash my back.

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:26.650
To tell you the truth, I got a little overheated at that point and can't remember much,

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:29.210
...and it's never happened again since then...

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:32.080
What, you didn't get a good, long look, then?

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:36.330
No, I was in shock at the time.

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:37.890
Oh, I see.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:45.670
Women are wonderful creatures. They're warm and soft and smooth.

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:49.200
Haven't you ever wished that you'd at least gotten a good look?

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:52.060
Sure I want to look... But...

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.700
So, you say you want to look, huh?

00:13:56.730 --> 00:13:58.650
Okay, climb onto my shoulders.

00:13:59.030 --> 00:14:00.150
Uh, but...

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:02.950
The old must give way to the young.

00:14:03.390 --> 00:14:04.310
C'mon, hop on!

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:05.880
Here goes, then.

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:23.950
The old squeeze and lift is a mark of feminine smarts!

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:25.810
Just kidding!

00:14:30.380 --> 00:14:31.810
It's hopeless.

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:36.960
I-I just can't do it!

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.960
Keep your voice down!

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:42.560
What do you think you're doing?!

00:14:42.560 --> 00:14:44.370
Hot hot hot hot!

00:14:45.140 --> 00:14:49.230
How many times to I have to tell you that dirty thoughts are bad before it will sink in?

00:14:49.770 --> 00:14:53.630
Instead of being a good role model for Suguru, you're putting funny thoughts in his head!

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:55.700
Point!

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:56.840
C-Counterpoint!

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:03.210
Listen, Mahoro, I'm told that you yourself got buck-naked and got into the bath with Suguru.

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:05.660
Wasn't THAT dirty?

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:07.010
Eep!

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:13.720
I... I realized that I went too far, and I regret my actions even now.

00:15:14.670 --> 00:15:15.670
You do, do you?

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:17.390
Yes, I do.

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:19.680
Point!

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:21.020
C-Counterpoint!

00:15:21.610 --> 00:15:24.790
Minawa here is an apprentice maid, right?

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:29.790
So, your code of ethics won't let her take a bath with Suguru?

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:34.890
O-Of course not! I'm a maid who is always striving for perfection!

00:15:36.650 --> 00:15:42.050
So, what would happen if they were together? What perversions did you imagine?!

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.300
Point...!

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:47.720
Counterpoint...

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:51.390
Well, my good maid who always has perversion on her mind,

00:15:51.790 --> 00:15:56.720
...I believe that the most perverted person around here is YOU!

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:03.040
Well, we're gonna turn in! Good night!

00:16:04.380 --> 00:16:07.770
I-I'm perverted... I'm perverted...

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:07.510
Let's go to bed, big sister.

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:13.240
Suguru, you awake?

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:16.450
Think Mahoro's asleep by now?

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:19.130
Wanna go look in on her?

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:22.870
That's about enough, Grandpa! What did you come here for, anyway?!

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.100
I was kidding.

00:16:27.870 --> 00:16:29.680
About those girls this afternoon...

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:32.090
Do you have your heart set on one of them?

00:16:32.640 --> 00:16:34.880
I guess that includes that teacher of yours with the glasses.

00:16:35.480 --> 00:16:39.110
From what I saw, they're all sweet on you.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:44.350
For starters, Ms. Shikijo is my teacher.

00:16:41.350 --> 00:16:45.320
Pay attention, these parts are important.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:47.510
And I've known Miyuki, Rin,

00:16:47.050 --> 00:16:49.890
Suguru! Let's play!

00:16:47.510 --> 00:16:49.240
...and Chizuru since kindergarten.

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:52.880
I don't want things to get  awkward, so...

00:16:51.100 --> 00:16:52.200
Suguru...

00:16:52.830 --> 00:16:53.600
Suguru...

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:55.450
Suguru...

00:16:56.030 --> 00:16:57.500
You're an upstanding young man.

00:16:58.730 --> 00:17:00.460
Don't get me wrong, that's a fine thing,

00:17:00.930 --> 00:17:05.570
...but are you sure you want to narrow your options like that before you're even grown up?

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:13.740
Aren't you just trying to play it safe, acting differently for different people?

00:17:14.610 --> 00:17:15.880
W-What do you...

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:19.510
You're not one to talk, Grandpa!

00:17:20.110 --> 00:17:26.910
Listen, Suguru. It's when a man realizes that he isn't cool that he can become cool.

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:30.720
If you stay the same boring kid you've always been,

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:33.550
...all you're going to become is a boring man.

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:47.410
Are you sure you won't stay with us a while longer?

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:51.090
We still have lots and lots of food that I'd like you to try.

00:17:52.490 --> 00:17:57.310
I'm just glad that you're in good health. Both Suguru and you.

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:03.340
It was a big shock to learn that you were Suguru's grandfather, Leader.

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:07.590
Yeah, well, that IS top secret.

00:18:08.430 --> 00:18:12.980
After I'm gone... please look after Minawa.

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:16.820
Isn't it a little early to be worrying about that?

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:23.000
There's still something dark and horrible that's haunting her.

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:28.350
But I can see the pure, innocent heart that's deep inside her.

00:18:30.120 --> 00:18:36.110
By keeping her near me, I think something major is going to happen soon.

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:39.730
It might be extremely dangerous,

00:18:40.420 --> 00:18:44.250
...but I want to save her. I want to save Minawa, no matter what.

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:46.700
I must be crazy.

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:51.460
Ever since I was born, I'd taken my own death for granted,

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:54.770
...but now I'm incredibly scared of dying.

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:57.380
I'm glad to hear that.

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:02.770
That means that you've found something that you don't want to lose.

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:14.040
Well, now that I know that, I've done all I came to do here.

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:18.440
You take care of yourself, too, all right, Minawa?

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:19.800
Y-Yes, sir.

00:19:20.670 --> 00:19:23.240
Look after Suguru, Miss Mahoro.

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:24.240
Yes, sir.

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:29.360
If I keep acting so informal with you, Suguru's gonna get jealous.

00:19:30.820 --> 00:19:31.390
Suguru.

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:34.280
Grow up to be a good man.

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:37.890
Sure.

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:47.980
I still can't figure out why Grandpa showed up all of a sudden.

00:19:48.570 --> 00:19:50.480
I know how busy he is, so why now?

00:19:51.810 --> 00:19:55.710
It's probably because the day is fast approaching when the fates...

00:19:56.210 --> 00:19:57.750
...of both Saint and Earthling will be decided.

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:05.660
So Leader wanted to see us one more time before then.

00:20:15.130 --> 00:20:18.560
It would seem that we have no option but to cut the power to the main computer.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.590
B-But that's crazy!

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:23.380
Fine, see if I care.

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:36.050
It's one big panic over there, Professor.

00:20:36.980 --> 00:20:39.030
All we did was attempt to reproduce it by sampling...

00:20:39.030 --> 00:20:41.750
...the data we've collected so far, and look what happened...

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:43.340
What sort of data?

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:44.950
What else?

00:20:45.620 --> 00:20:46.560
Mahoro.

00:20:48.110 --> 00:20:50.850
Professor, you have a call from Deputy Commander Santrio.

00:20:51.400 --> 00:20:53.130
Tell him I'll call back later.

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:54.150
Y-Yes, sir!

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:59.950
All the data is splitting and branching, almost as if it's an organic system.

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:02.840
This data could almost be called beautiful...

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:08.590
But I don't understand it... This is far too complicated for a mere combat android.

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:10.570
What are you going to do, then?

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:16.040
If these roundabout measures are getting us nowhere,

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:19.070
...we'll just have to change methods.

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:30.510
<b>Mahoro stops functioning in...</b>

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:30.510
