00:23:22.410 --> 00:23:23.340
Come over to my place!

00:23:23.980 --> 00:23:26.180
Soak up to your shoulders in our huge baths,

00:23:26.750 --> 00:23:28.940
...stretch out your arms and legs, and breathe deep.

00:23:29.520 --> 00:23:31.330
And when you're done, put your hand on your hip...

00:23:31.490 --> 00:23:32.440
...and drink some fruit-flavored milk.

00:23:32.960 --> 00:23:35.320
This will refresh both your body and spirit.

00:23:35.990 --> 00:23:38.430
Let's go at it in high spirits again tomorrow!

